>greet_prog 50~
mpechoat $n $I smiles at you.
tell $n Welcome to the City of Eternity, $n.
tell $n Enjoy your stay.
~
>give_prog I27387~
if quest (0, 1, $o) == 0
   mposet inducer quest 0 1 1
   mpecho A blue flash flames through the sky!
   mpecho The inducer releases it's spell.
   sleep
endif
if quest (0, 1, $o) == 1
   mpecho A blue flash flames through the sky!
   mpecho The inducer releases it's spell.
   mpjunk I27387
   sleep
endif
~
>fight_prog 25~
if rand(20)
 mpecho $I twists the magic protecting you, shattering them!
 mpquiet on
 cast 'dispel magic' $n
 mpquiet off
else
 mpecho $I taps a nearby node and channels the power.
 cast 'fireball' $n
endif
~
>speech_prog p version~
say This is version 4.0 of the City of Eternity 
say coded by Mazrim Taim (winchell@cs.ucr.edu)
say with help from Emperor 
say Thanks for asking.
~
>death_prog 100~
if rand(15)
   mpasound An Armored Statue howls in rage and despair!
   mpecho $I ruthlessly taps deep into a nearby node.
   mpecho $I utters the words 'dujak zfroli'.
   mpasound An Armored Statue calls down his Final Strike!
   mpecho $I disintegrates in a blinding explosion.
   mass fireball
   mass fireball
endif
mpquiet on
remove all
drop all
mpquiet off
~
