#27385
Sir Hugh engineer~
Sir Hugh~
Sir Hugh, the brilliant engineer, stands here working on a project.~
Sir Hugh seems to be a rather quiet, unassuming sort of fellow, but he has
a definite gleam of genius in his eyes.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_RACE
AFF_SANCTUARY
500 S
95 0 0 3d100+10000 3d4+86
50000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>rand_prog 90~
if quest (0, 4, $r) == 2
  say Hello there, $r. James said he'd send someone along.
  say The sundial is broken right?
else
endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
if quest (0, 4, $n) == 2
  nod
  sigh
  say I have fixed that blasted thing so many times...
  say Well, no matter.  Let me see what I can do with it.
  say Give it to me.
endif
~
>give_prog I27390~
if quest (0, 4, $n) == 2
  say Hmm...
  mpecho $I takes the sundial over to a workbench, and fiddles with it.
  say Ah. Here's the problem... and this should about fix it.
  mpjunk I27390
  mpoload 27391
  mpmset $n quest 0 4 3
  mpquiet on
  cast 'giant strength' $n
  mpquiet off
  give I27391 $n
  say There you are.  
  say Please give it back to James
  say Be sure to tell him to be more careful in the future.
else
  mpecho $I looks quite puzzled.
  say And just what was the purpose of giving me this?
  give I27390 $n
endif
~
>speech_prog equipment help~
if quest (0,4,$n) >= 7
  say Oho!  So James talked you into helping him, eh?  
  say Well, in the event that you should need it, here's a sundial 
  say similar to the one that James has.
  say Just look at the sundial for a listing of special options. 
  say This particular model will search for hidden compartments 
  say and help open them. Really rather handy, in the proper situation.
  mpoload 27406
  mpquiet on
  cast 'giant strength' $n
  mpquiet off
  give I27406 $n
  say Hmm... I've also started working on something called an 'inducer'.
endif
~
>speech_prog inducer~
if quest (0,4,$n) >= 7 
  nod
  say You know how the guards at the gates can be a bit bothersome?
  say Well, I found a way to...get them out of the way
  smile
  say I call it a 'sleep inducer'.  
  say When you give it to them, and they just nod off. 
  snicker
  say Simply say 'sure' if you would like one
endif
~
>speech_prog sure~
if quest (0,4,$n) >= 7
  say Ok, here you go.
  mpquiet on
  cast 'giant strength' $n
  mpquiet off
  mpoload 27387
  mposet inducer quest 0 1 0
  say Now remember, it only has two charges on it.  
  say Come back to me and say 'another' if you need a replacement.
  give inducer $n
endif
~
>speech_prog another~
if quest (0,4,$n) >= 7
  if actorhasobjnum(27387)
     poke $n
     say You already have one.
     snicker
  else
     nod $n
     mpoload 27387
     mposet inducer 0 1 0
     give inducer $n
     say There you go.
  endif 
endif 
~ 
| 
