#27404
fine jeweled throwing dagger~
a fine jeweled throwing dagger~
A beautifully crafted dagger lies here on the ground.~
This dagger is crafted with a skill unlike anything that you have ever seen 
before.  The balance is perfect for both throwing and close infighting.  The 
blade is like a razor, and the hilt is of amazing workmanship.  The 
pommelstone of this dagger is a blood-red ruby of perfect clarity.  You would 
not be too surprised to learn that blood had been shed over this blade.~
ITEM_TYPE_WEAPON
ITEM_FLAG_LEVEL
ITEM_WEAR_TAKE|ITEM_WEAR_WIELD
0 7 6 2
5 250000 65
#27405
fountain~
A fountain~
An exquisite fountain spouts glowing, blue water here.~
This fountain is one of the more interesting fountains that you have seen in 
your travels.  It has been carefully shaped with magical power, and a sense 
of peace and harmony radiate from it.  While the bluish glow in the water is 
unusual, it somehow seems to fit in with the rest of this city.  In any case, 
it doesn't seem to be bothering the birds that are drinking from it.~
ITEM_TYPE_FOUNTAIN
ITEM_FLAG_LEVEL
0
0 0 0 0
5000 0 1
#27406
sundial shielded working~
a shielded sundial~
A high quality sundial lies here.~
This is really quite a nice sundial...hmmm...it doesn't seem to be quite 
normal. It's not glowing...wait a second... there seems to be an
'inscription' on it as well as a listing of some 'options'.~
ITEM_TYPE_ARMOR
ITEM_FLAG_LEVEL
ITEM_WEAR_TAKE|ITEM_WEAR_WRIST
12 0 0 0
2 800000 85
A
APPLY_HITROLL 10
E
inscription~
.             Made in the City of Eternity.~
E
options~
When you press the stone with the word 'options' engraved on it, 
mist rises from the sundial and two words form in the mist -- 
'avem' and 'ulik'.
~
P 1
TRIG_UNKNOWN 100 avem
OPROG_IF OIF_WEAR_LOC = WEAR_NONE 3 2
P 2
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_ROOM_NUM = 27477 4 5
P 3
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO You are not wearing the sundial.~
P 4
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO The gems around the edge of the dial begin to glow.~
P 4
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO Beams of golden light shoot from the gems, merging in the center.~
P 4
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO The dial begins to glow, and a beam lances out, sweeping the room.~
P 4
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO The beam indicates a secret compartment in the floor!~
P 4
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO The glow stops.~
P 5
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO The gems around the edge of the dial begin to glow.~
P 5
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO Beams of golden light shoot from the gems, merging in the center.~
P 5
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO The dial begins to glow, and a beam lances out, sweeping the room.~
P 5
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO After a couple of minutes, the glow stops.~
P 6
TRIG_UNKNOWN 100 ulik
OPROG_IF OIF_WEAR_LOC = WEAR_NONE 8 7
P 7
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_ROOM_NUM = 27477 9 10
P 8
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO You are not wearing the sundial.~
P 9
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO A glowing mist begins to form around the sundial.~
P 9
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO A golden beam shoots out of the mist and sweeps the room.~
P 9
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO Suddenly, the mist coalesces, and a key falls into your hand.~
P 9
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_GOD_COMMAND mpoload 27407 ~
P 10
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO A glowing mist begins to form around the sundial.~
P 10
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO A golden beam shoots out of the mist and sweeps the room.~
P 10
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO The mist dissapates.~
