#27473
A small, seedy tavern~
This tavern is definitely on the cramped side.  The ceiling is low, and the 
place is lit by some small, dim lanterns and mage lights.  The smell of cheap
liquor, smoke, greasy food, and cheap perfume.  Of all the bars, taverns, pubs,
and flophouses you have been in, this one is very close to the bottom of the 
list. It's amazing that a city as wonderful as this could have 
such a...a...sewer of society in it.~
