#27474
The back of the tavern~
There are not as many people here, and the light is bad.  The funny thing is, 
that you would think that the *further* from the door, the more people there 
would be.  The furniture is in better condition, yet the only people here are 
drunks, for the most part.  Wait!  Was that a movement in the corner?~
