#27475
A dark cellar~
You are standing in a dark, crowded cellar.  There are casks of ale and jugs
of liquor piled high in here.  Crates of assorted items line the walls, and the
entire place smells of wood, some dust, alcohol, and other, less pleasant, 
smells.  You do not like the thought of trying to make a light in here to 
dispel the gloom.  The faint dripping you hear is probably water. But it 
*could* be alcohol, and lighting *that* could be more than a little 
unpleasant.~
