#27477
Lethalis Darkmaster's Study~
The study which you have sought is strangely incongruent with the decor of the
rest of this part of town.  This room looks like it has been teleported right 
out of a palace.  Opulent is the word that comes to mind as you gaze upon the 
rich paintings and tapestries that hang in this room.  The room is splendidly 
well-lit.  One painting in particular catches your eye.~
