painting~
This isn't a painting. . .not exactly.  It appears to be a customized throwing
knife target. The image that graces this target is none other than your friend,
Sir James!  A fancy dagger--with a richly jewelled hilt, and a pommelstone to 
kill for--protrudes from between James' eyes. Hmm. . .no wonder James couldn't
get in here, not if he wanted to come out alive, and in one piece.~
