#27478
A shadowy alley~
This is a dark alley, scarcely six feet wide.  What is not plunged in darkness
is shadowed. The really peculiar thing about the situation is the fact that no
one on the street seems to even notice that this alley even exists.  Assorted 
litter clutters the alley, making silent movement next to impossible.  There 
almost seems to be some sort of hole in one of the larger piles in the back.~
