stench of decay coming from somewhere.  A large rat skitters out from 
underfoot, and you catch sight of what has got to be the *BIGGEST* rat tail 
that you have ever seen in your life disappearing into a hole in the wall.  
Hey! Is that a light that you see up ahead?~
