#27480
Entrance to the underside of the City of Eternity~
You are in a dimly lit area.  While other parts of the City of Eternity seem to
be crowned in shining light, this place seems to be cloaked in shadows, and the
light is dim indeed. Other, darker places come to mind--the Darkside in fallen
Thalos; the famed Sharthea which lies in ruins; Death Alley in that place of 
Order, Mount Kolvir--and even though this place has a ways to go before it 
reaches that level of decay, things certainly are heading that way.~
