#27481
The underside of the City of Eternity~
You see an entirely different side of the City.  Where the citizens in the rest
of the city live in peace, harmony, and happiness, the people here live in 
fear, and by their wits. The sounds and smells of rowdy pleasure assail your 
senses.  You see beggars and pickpockets, thieves and whores moving around, 
trying to eke out a meager existence.  The occasional mutter about the 'damned
better half' reaches your ears.~
