#27489
A short tube~
You are crawling in a small access tube.  It seems to be meant for maintenance
purposes. At one end, there is a small metal grate, secured from the inside.  
On the other end, there is a cover made of some strange, translucent material.
Whatever this stuff is, it is exceptionally durable.  A small date that 
appears to be embedded in the middle of the stuff claims that this cover was 
made about two thousand years ago, yet it looks like it was made just 
yesterday.  There is something else that you notice about the grate, now that 
you see it from this side. . .no water is getting through it!~
